cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite gwrs when using the software, and acknowledge the accompanying paper and Census sources when using its prepared ACS data."
title: "gwrs: Fast Geographically Weighted Regression and Selection"
type: software
version: 0.4.0.9015
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
authors:
  - family-names: Yuzbasi
    given-names: Bahadir
repository-code: "https://github.com/byuzbasi/gwrs"
url: "https://github.com/byuzbasi/gwrs"
abstract: >-
  Geographically weighted Ridge, Lasso, Elastic Net, SCAD and MCP in R,
  with local variable selection, spatial cross-validation, prediction,
  regularization paths, joint ordinary-GWR model selection and a
  documented ACS county analysis dataset.
keywords:
  - geographically weighted regression
  - local variable selection
  - SCAD
  - MCP
  - spatial cross-validation
  - R
